      "prevailing_wage_trigger": "true",
      "layering_notes": "Richmond is part of the Contra Costa Urban County and therefore of the County HOME Consortium, so Richmond projects apply to the County for CDBG-Housing, HOME and Measure X (county records); the County's May 2026 awards to Trinity Plaza ($2.5 million CDBG and $1.5 million HOME) are consistent with this. Stack with the Richmond/Contra Costa CoC (CA-505), HACCC PBVs and Richmond housing successor assets. Audit November 8, 2026: the earlier statement that Richmond is an entitlement jurisdiction outside the Consortium was wrong; the Housing Element (HUD funding discussion and Housing Resources, CDBG) and the County CDBG page both place Richmond in the Urban County.",
